 "remarks": "Great opportunity to enjoy everything the coastal village of Rowayton has to offer! Set on a lovely lot along a very quiet street in a serene woodsy neighborhood (but just a ten-minute walk to the train station and short drive to beach, shopping, dining, schools and parks) this ranch style home features a cozy fireplace, private deck, hardwood floors and partially finished multi-purpose basement. Property is planted with 30 plus years of flowering perennials including azaleas, hydrangeas, day lilies, roses, and more. Absolutely stunning in Spring! If you've been looking for the perfect combination of location, comfort and quietude then look no further.",
